+!> LOCAL EXTENSION: append one bond constraint to the list of bonds that came
+!> from the constraint input file.  The list is grown in chunks of 16 entries;
+!> real constraint files hold a handful of bonds, so the reallocation cost is
+!> irrelevant and the bookkeeping stays trivial.
+!>
